      "writtenOn": "2021-11-19T06:28:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No the subscriber Id(IMSI) is the longer one and it is stored on the card, so the problem you described never happens since it never changes.\n\nI think what you are talking about is the subscription ID/subId which will changes after device reset. That\u0027s a good point, but not for this CL since we don\u0027t have subId field yet.\nI think it will happen in pratice when we are doing the Remove IMSI project. Noted on the doc and let\u0027s discuss that in later meeting.",
